WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.402
Aw ye nin kibaroya lamɛn, aw minw ye Gulmu dugumɔgɔw ye; aw ye nin ye, aw bɛmaw bɛ o kibaroyaw fɔra jamana terebɔyanfan na, Fada N'Guruma ta mɔgɔw fɛ.

00:00:12.482 --> 00:00:16.563
O kow daminɛna tuma min na masacɛ tun tɛ mɔgɔw fɛ.

00:00:16.643 --> 00:00:23.803
Denbaya kelen kelen bɛɛ tun b'a yɛrɛ ta sariyaw labato, ani bɛnbaliya tun tɛ ban abada.

00:00:23.883 --> 00:00:28.546
Lɔnnikɛla dɔ y'a fɔ ko loon dɔ, sankaso dayɛlɛla ka yɛlɛ.

00:00:28.626 --> 00:00:34.288
Cɛɛ dɔ jigira ka bɔ dugu kɔnɔ, ale ni a tɔɲɔgɔnw, ani a borofɛnw bɛɛ.

00:00:34.368 --> 00:00:36.452
A tɔgɔ tun ko Diaba Lompo.

00:00:36.532 --> 00:00:40.280
A bɔra cogo min na, o tɛ kelen ye Bibulu kɔnɔ.

00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:47.769
Musaw ka landa dɔ b'a fɔ ko ale ye Yennenga sunguru dencɛ ye ani Rialé tun ye jagokɛla ye.

00:00:47.849 --> 00:00:51.347
O dugumɔgɔw tun bɛ siran o lonancɛ ɲa fɔlɔ.

00:00:51.427 --> 00:00:54.260
Nka, Diaba Lompo tun ma na kɛlɛ kɛ.

00:00:54.340 --> 00:01:02.332
Bibulu b'a fɔ ko a tun be mɛnni kɛ, ka koow latigɛ ni hakilitigiya ye ani ka bɛnbaliyakow ɲɛnabɔ.

00:01:02.412 --> 00:01:09.322
Wagati dɔ nana se minkɛ, o ta somɔgɔw nana lɔ a kɔrɔ ka o ta bɛnbaliyakow ɲafɔ a ye.

00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:12.234
A ka kuma min fɔ, o kɛra sariya ye.

00:01:12.314 --> 00:01:15.147
Mɔgɔw k'a mɛn ko a ka jamana labɛn.

00:01:15.227 --> 00:01:21.138
A ka kuntigiw sigi duguw bɛɛ ra, ka sariyaw, ani kolatigɛninw sigi a ye.

00:01:21.218 --> 00:01:24.717
O kɔ, a ka jamanatigiw sigi a dencɛw kunna.

00:01:24.797 --> 00:01:29.626
O cogo kelen na, Gulmu mara tun bena kɛ Gourmanche mara ye.

00:01:29.706 --> 00:01:37.033
Mɔgɔw b'a fɔ ko Gulmu masacɛw bɔra Diaba Lompo dugu la ani k'u sigiyɔrɔ be Fada N'Gourma.

00:01:37.113 --> 00:01:48.932
Mɔgɔ minw bɔra sankolo ra, o tɛ mɔgɔ kelen dɔrɔn le ye, nka o bɛ siya kelen bɛɛ jɛn ka kɛ kelen ye, ka bɔ ɲɔgɔn na, ani ka sɔn o ta cifɔnin ma.

00:01:49.012 --> 00:02:00.083
Ni aw ka o cɛkɔrɔbaw ɲininka, k'a lɔn ni nin kow bɛɛ ye can ye wa, o bɛ yɛlɛ o ma ko: ‹Sankolo ka bon, nka an ta kow bɛɛ bɛ an cɛ ra.›
